  "item": "R1",
  "scores": {"U": 2, "A": 2, "C": 3, "V": 1},
  "confidences": {"U": 0.85, "A": 0.9, "C": 0.75, "V": 0.95},
  "rationales": {"U":"原文使用抽象元描述'what must be accomplished'和模糊术语'requirements document'、'concept of operations'，未定义其范围或约束；读者需外部知识才能理解该句实际指涉对象，例如'what'是否包含 functional/non-functional/external interface requirements？证据片段：'what must be accomplished to fulfill the vision described in a concept of operations'；该表述缺乏上下文锚点，导致可理解性严重依赖隐含假设。","A":"'requirements document'和'concept of operations'均为未界定术语，存在多义性（如CoE可指DoD标准文档或 internal stakeholder narrative）；'states'一词未明确主体（作者？ tool？ process？），且'must be accomplished'未量化或限定边界（时间？ scope？ compliance level？）。证据片段：'A requirements document states what must be accomplished...'；同一短语在不同组织中可解释为模板规范、审批输出物或协作工件，违反无歧义性。","C":"该陈述在需求工程本体论中基本成立，符合IEEE/ISO对需求文档目的的通用定义，但将'vision'等同于'concept of operations'内容存在概念滑移——CoE通常包含愿景但还涵盖运行场景、角色、环境假设等，故'fulfill the vision described in a concept of operations'过度简化了CoE的信息承载范围。证据片段：'fulfill the vision described in a concept of operations'；此表述弱化了CoE的多维性，属轻微概念不准确。","V":"无可观测、可判定的验收条件：无法通过测试、检查或演示验证某文档是否'fulfills the vision'，因'vision'未形式化定义，'fulfill'无操作性判据（如覆盖率阈值、用例映射率、利益相关方签字确认等）。证据片段：'to fulfill the vision described in a concept of operations'；该短语完全不可证伪，亦无量化基准或验证方法指引。"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"The requirements specification document shall contain a traceable mapping from each stated requirement to at least one operational scenario or stakeholder goal explicitly defined in the approved Concept of Operations (CoE) document.","A":"The approved Concept of Operations (CoE) document, version-controlled and formally baselined per IEEE Std 1220-2016, shall serve as the sole authoritative source for operational vision and context; the requirements specification document shall list every requirement with a mandatory 'CoE-Origin' attribute referencing the specific CoE section, table, or figure from which it derives.","C":"保持不变","V":"For each requirement in the requirements specification document, the project shall demonstrate bidirectional traceability to the Concept of Operations (CoE) document via a validated traceability matrix; the coverage ratio (number of CoE elements linked to ≥1 requirement / total CoE operational goals and scenarios) shall be ≥95%, verified by independent audit prior to system requirements review."},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"what must be accomplished to fulfill the vision described in a concept of operations","rewrite":"The requirements specification document shall contain a traceable mapping from each stated requirement to at least one operational scenario or stakeholder goal explicitly defined in the approved Concept of Operations (CoE) document."},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"A requirements document states what must be accomplished","rewrite":"The approved Concept of Operations (CoE) document, version-controlled and formally baselined per IEEE Std 1220-2016, shall serve as the sole authoritative source for operational vision and context; the requirements specification document shall list every requirement with a mandatory 'CoE-Origin' attribute referencing the specific CoE section, table, or figure from which it derives."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"to fulfill the vision described in a concept of operations","rewrite":"For each requirement in the requirements specification document, the project shall demonstrate bidirectional traceability to the Concept of Operations (CoE) document via a validated traceability matrix; the coverage ratio (number of CoE elements linked to ≥1 requirement / total CoE operational goals and scenarios) shall be ≥95%, verified by independent audit prior to system requirements review."}
  ]
}
